Lava host harness, 60s, 16 ms/frame, light switch D7 ON, mushroom D11 pressed (after arming).
fix=410. Centre of 160 LEDs is 79.5. Physics peak is pos/fix. visMaxLed0 is the highest lit pixel nearer the bottom ball; visTravel1 is how far the top ball's lit pixels come down from LED 159.
Before the fix, A1=512 locked ball 0 on led 60.373 after the opening toss. These numbers are after the per-bounce span advance.

